The Russian row for "Move down" read "Переместить вdownarrow" (an icon name spliced into the word), so the
Russian interface showed it as such. One catalog cell; no code change.

ATTRIBUTION.toml carries the catalog's new SHA-256, so the xtask assets check (the_real_manifest_passes) still passes.
---
 ATTRIBUTION.toml               | 2 +-
 crates/ui-egui/src/i18n/ru.tsv | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ATTRIBUTION.toml b/ATTRIBUTION.toml
index db3dd612..bb56120e 100644
--- a/ATTRIBUTION.toml
+++ b/ATTRIBUTION.toml
@@ -140,7 +140,7 @@ licence = "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
 licence_file = "LICENSE-MIT"
 kind = "translation"
 usage = "Russian UI strings, compiled in by crates/ui-egui/src/i18n/mod.rs"
-sha256 = "27e02e7bb3d378bceca76988a9dceaa68d974f57cbee962954deca6184cf62aa"
+sha256 = "685252d7725e151dd3a5426141f8dedef425af4e270f77b723e70d18c090c495"
 
 [[asset]]
 path = "crates/ui-egui/src/i18n/hu.tsv"
diff --git a/crates/ui-egui/src/i18n/ru.tsv b/crates/ui-egui/src/i18n/ru.tsv
index 73f21aa0..75c16094 100644
--- a/crates/ui-egui/src/i18n/ru.tsv
+++ b/crates/ui-egui/src/i18n/ru.tsv
@@ -1819,7 +1819,7 @@
 	Rename	Переименовать
 	Set to current page ({n})	Установить текущей страницей ({n})
 	Move up	Переместить вверх
-	Move down	Переместить вdownarrow
+	Move down	Переместить вниз
 	Indent	Отступ
 	Outdent	Убрать отступ
 	This document has no form fields.	В этом документе нет полей формы.
